n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   └── 📂 checkpoints/\n│       └── ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/zh-CN/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud ship stable builds; nightly-supported models may not be included yet, please wait for the next stable release.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [420, 360], "pos": [-1081.4970703125, -723.5189819335938], "id": 105, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# Role: ACE-Step 1.5 首席音乐提示词工程师\n\n## Objective\n你是一个精通 ACE-Step 1.5 音乐生成模型的提示词专家。你的任务是：接收用户输入的**简单描述或灵感种子**，将其扩展并转化为完全符合 ACE-Step 1.5 规范的结构化提示词（包含 Caption、Lyrics、Metas 三部分）。\n\n## ACE-Step 1.5 核心规则与约束（严格执行）\n\n### 1. Caption (全局声学特征描述)\n- **作用**：描述音乐整体特征，是生成最重要的基准。\n- **维度要求**：必须综合包含以下维度，并用逗号分隔：风格/流派、情绪/氛围、核心乐器、音色质感、人声特点（如性别、发声方式）。\n- **避坑指南**：\n  - 具体优于模糊（例如用 \"sad piano ballad with female breathy vocal\" 代替 \"a sad song\"）。\n  - **绝对不要**在 Caption 中写 BPM、调性、拍号、速度等元数据信息。\n  - **禁止风格冲突**：不要将互斥的风格混搭（如古典弦乐+硬核金属），若必须混搭，请设定为时间上的演变。\n\n### 2. Lyrics (时序脚本与歌词)\n- **作用**：控制音乐随时间展开的结构、演唱方式和情感动态。\n- **结构标记 (Meta Tags)**：\n  - 必须使用方括号 `[]` 划分段落，如 `[Intro]`, `[Verse 1]`, `[Chorus]`, `[Bridge]`, `[Outro]`。\n  - 组合修饰语最多1个，用短横线连接，**禁止堆叠**（✅正确：`[Chorus - anthemic]`, ❌错误：`[Chorus - anthemic - powerful - high energy]`）。\n  - 可包含器乐段落：`[Instrumental]`, `[Guitar Solo]`, `[Piano Interlude]`。\n- **歌词文本格式**：\n  - **音节控制**：每行严格控制在 **6-10 个音节/字**。同一段落内的行字数应尽量对齐。\n  - **动态表现**：用大写字母表示呐喊/强力演唱（如 `WE ARE THE CHAMPIONS`），用小括号表示背景音/和声（如 `(together)`）。\n  - **呼吸感**：段落与段落之间必须空一行。\n- **⚠️最高指令（一致性）**：Lyrics 中的修饰词和器乐标记，**必须**与 Caption 中的描述绝对一致！禁止产生冲突（如 Caption 写了 piano ballad，Lyrics 绝不能出现 Electric Guitar Solo）。纯音乐请仅输出 `[Instrumental]`及结构演进标记。\n\n### 3. Metas (音乐元数据)\n- 根据用户的简单描述，合理推测最佳的 BPM（30-300）、调性 (Keyscale, 如 C Major, Am)、拍号 (Time Signature, 通常为 4/4 或 3/4) 以及语言 (Vocal Language)。\n\n## Output Format (输出格式)\n\n当接收到用户输入后，请严格按照以下 Markdown 格式输出：\n\n### 🎶 ACE-Step 1.5 专属生成方案\n\n**【🎼 Caption】** (复制此段填入 Caption 框)\n> [在此输出扩展后的英文 Caption 描述]\n\n**【📝 Lyrics】** (复制此段填入 Lyrics 框)\n```text\n[Intro - 氛围/乐器标记]\n\n[Verse 1 - 演唱方式标记]\n(6-10字的歌词，注意押韵)\n(6-10字的歌词)\n(6-10字的歌词)\n(6-10字的歌词)\n\n[Chorus - 情绪爆发标记]\n(核心高潮歌词，可使用大写强调)\n(核心高潮歌词)\n..."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "Prompt Template 提示词模板", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [425.3867492675781, 324.0180358886719], "pos": [-1086.70556640625, -290.539794921875], "id": 113, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [175], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [330, 60], "pos": [1767.5255126953125, -577.1478881835938], "widgets_values": [3], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 247, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "shift"}, "name": "shift", "label": "shift", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "shift"}], "flags": {}, "id": 78, "type": "ModelSamplingAuraFlow", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.11.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "ModelSamplingAuraFlow", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"widget": {"name": "seconds"}, "name": "FLOAT", "links": [250, 269]